1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,824
The outside pressure came from the company itself.

2
00:00:02,824 --> 00:00:16,849
The central firm, a modest agency with one garage and a division of four, asked them to join a general workshop on the farm: a recruit, a veteran, and a commander would all be there.

3
00:00:16,849 --> 00:00:20,473
“You have the ability,” the boss said.

4
00:00:20,473 --> 00:00:24,122
“What you do not have is unity.”

5
00:00:24,122 --> 00:00:29,210
Behind the plan was a committee of veterans who administered the course.

6
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:37,428
They had a troop of volunteers, a gang of part-time drivers, a mess hall, and a laundry.

7
00:00:37,428 --> 00:00:42,796
“We better continue the sort in the same order,” the moderator said.

8
00:00:42,796 --> 00:00:52,183
“Separation is not dignity.” A penny of speculation was worth more to them than a stripe of seniority.

9
00:00:52,183 --> 00:01:02,254
The workshop was about reproduction, ore, and the ant: small things that a company can command, and large things it cannot.

10
00:01:02,254 --> 00:01:08,647
“Do not offend the part of the picture you cannot see,” the heroine of the film said.

11
00:01:08,647 --> 00:01:13,010
“That is the tangible chore of management.”

12
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:22,117
The master plan required a successor, a separation payment, and a knit of two departments that had never spoken.

13
00:01:22,117 --> 00:01:37,662
“I realize the cost,” the commander said, “and I help you establish it in writing.” The impress of the whole scheme was, especially at first, one of quiet administration.

14
00:01:37,662 --> 00:01:49,732
The tangible result was postage: they mailed the computation, the plan, and a picture of the garage to the department, and the department raised a question about the pay.

15
00:01:49,732 --> 00:01:54,846
“The tangible part is the part we can raise,” the boss said.

16
00:01:54,846 --> 00:02:05,167
“The rest is what we believe about ourselves.” Two veterans were due to retire, and the firm had not yet named a successor for either.

17
00:02:05,167 --> 00:02:27,864
“You can impress a board,” the commander said, “but you cannot impress a garage.” The general plan, the central workshop, and the modest farm were all part of the same course: the ability to command a troop is not the ability to administer a division, and a company that forgets this ends in a mess.

18
00:02:27,864 --> 00:02:40,831
A reproduction of a nineteenth-century contract, with its clause on slavery, hung in the corridor behind the laundry; nobody had read it in years.
